rison With Estimation by Dietitians#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[35,36],"#Feasibility Study of an Automated Carbohydrate Estimation System Using Thai Food Images in Comparison With Estimation by Dietitians#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[37,39],"#Feasibility Study of an Automated Carbohydrate Estimation System Using Thai Food Images in Comparison With Estimation by Dietitians#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[40,42],"#Feasibility Study of an Automated Carbohydrate Estimation System Using Thai Food Images in Comparison With Estimation by Dietitians#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[41,42],"#Feasibility Study of an Automated Carbohydrate Estimation System Using Thai Food Images in Comparison With Estimation by Dietitians#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[43,44]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/UFS6UWEY","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/UG9WSJV9?page=1&annotation=4G7KZY6G","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/UG9WSJV9?page=1&annotation=4I6LBVNZ","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/UG9WSJV9?page=1&annotation=NDCZD84I","line":41}],"metadata":{"Title":"Feasibility Study of an Automated Carbohydrate Estimation System Using Thai Food Images in Comparison With Estimation by Dietitians","Authors":"Phawinpon Chotwanvirat, Narit Hnoohom, Nipa Rojroongwasinkul, Wantanee Kriengsinyos","Year":2021,"DOI":"10.3389/fnut.2021.732449","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"we developed a deep learning-based system for automatic carbohydrate counting using Thai food images taken from smartphonesAfter training, the system had a Top-1 accuracy of 80.9% and a root mean square error (RMSE) for carbohydrate estimation of <10 g in the test dataset. Another set of 20 images, which contained 48 food items in total, was used to compare the accuracy of carbohydrate estimations between measured weight, system estimation, and eight experienced registered dietitians (RDs).","Findings":"","Conclusions":"images). Hence, the system was satisfactory in terms of accurately estimating carbohydrate content, with results being comparable with those of experienced dietitians","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"dyt karş var  dyt=ai çıkmış"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"y96joz","at":1774939656454}},"smart_blocks:chotwanviratFeasibilityStudyAutomated2021b.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.04231991,0.0040686,0.01383307,0.01102151,0.00474099,0.03721403,0.024406,0.02363248,-0.00985255,-0.00647518,-0.00173331,-0.1388641,0.01390123,0.05099184,0.02341042,-0.02710451,0.05964965,0.003796,-0.00981486,-0.00057314,0.11476128,-0.06566141,0.01458864,-0.03402773,0.05509568,0.03117434,0.01896716,-0.03756937,-0.03817459,-0.24162252,0.03788176,-0.07011637,0.10358065,-0.0279227,-0.05143697,0.01463904,-0.03114679,0.02325011,-0.00994519,0.00785846,0.00456211,0.02096085,0.03241204,-0.00822137,0.01453033,-0.02127714,-0.09696811,0.02046451,-0.0503937,-0.04774459,0.01567061,-0.03266749,0.03632433,-0.00948605,-0.00878197,-0.01038622,0.02673478,0.03659337,0.07678965,0.03627908,0.05720419,0.10617072,-0.22582465,0.07156968,0.03977532,0.01620616,-0.02554816,-0.00286309,0.03650898,0.00841394,-0.00943589,0.03607472,0.03490679,0.0393521,-0.00868831,-0.03914399,0.04270687,-0.02930543,-0.05001393,-0.02555753,0.01700912,0.08363817,0.00600968,0.00309982,-0.03709905,-0.04040529,-0.00976175,-0.01057317,0.03951163,-0.05321946,0.00793079,-0.00353676,-0.00596587,0.0191315,-0.07974005,-0.00437084,-0.02113348,-0.04398879,-0.02829807,0.12341119,-0.01987419,-0.01999879,0.0488604,-0.00690992,0.0015896,-0.04691302,-0.07164056,-0.01136591,-0.00505789,0.05866099,-0.00136841,0.01082306,-0.01971863,-0.00510816,0.00533437,0.04298396,0.09700201,0.01264773,0.05212823,0.01491666,-0.06390446,0.015562,0.08838534